# (<= DSV41_DRAFT_HEAD_FP4_MAX_M rows, default 5 = one DSpark block, i.e. c1) through a CUDA-core GEMV (default launch
# 32,512,8,1, the GB10 bench's fastest); batched drafts keep the fp8 twin. Draft only: the target's logits and every
